cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline or the harmonised panel, please cite it as below."
title: "IFSB-DataHub: a reproducible pipeline for the IFSB Prudential and Structural Islamic Financial Indicators"
abstract: >-
  An R pipeline that harmonises the Islamic Financial Services Board's PSIFIs database
  (banking, takaful, Islamic capital markets, digital financial services) into an
  analysis-ready panel, correcting unit heterogeneity, year-to-date cumulation and
  within-year ratio gradients, with a full decisions log.
type: software
